{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-26","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平方与比例","englishTitle":"Similar plane numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number.","book":8,"number":26,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.26","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.26/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":26,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","contentId":"euclid-8-26","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00fcce6fc777d72f56cf80e1f1702b283225133ba0e9992a7d6be6b2640f669b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-26.statement","euclid-8-26.construction.1","euclid-8-26.proof.1","euclid-8-26.construction.2","euclid-8-26.conclusion","euclid-8-26.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-26.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-26","revisionId":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f5f4259ea943bde47eaa403d8cc12ae2ba6a92309bd48f21a14bccb3070f6db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar plane numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相似平面数比平方数比平方数比平方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-26.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-26","revisionId":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c6f22fed4afd7bcaabd777f0f19caf767be74f6a99d176c90d7cc3b44ed3861","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be similar plane numbers; I say that A has to B the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是相似平面数;我说,A比B比平方数比平方数比平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-26.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-26","revisionId":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0cef309c676dd66a139b759e2692118b6933662eeefd26b583510cae9463501","citations":["euclid-8-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B are similar plane numbers, therefore one mean proportional number falls between A, B. [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A以后,B是相似平面数,因此,比例中项的数字在A和B之间下降。 [[VIII. 18](/principles/euclid-8-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-26.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-26","revisionId":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"872afe18cc62b30a8e737ade4dfd608b909812d6445b078c5cfdb1c1e00842b2","citations":["euclid-7-33","euclid-8-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it so fall, and let it be C; and let D, E, F, the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with A, C, B, be taken; [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33) or [VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)] therefore the extremes of them D, F are square. [[VIII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它下降,让它下降C; D,E,F, 最小的 与A,C,B相同的比例, 或] 因此,其中的D,F是平方数。 [ [VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33) [VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2) [[VIII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-26.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-26","revisionId":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9569313f838e1b8c268b4688c82e6f5e0e872d195233668c9fe69d858f53dd46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as D is to F, so is A to B, and D, F are square, therefore A has to B the ratio which a square number has to a square number. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D比F等于A比B,D比平方数,F比D,因此A比B,平方数比平方数比平方数；D 与 F 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-26.source","contentId":"euclid-8-26","revisionId":"euclid-8-26@raw-00fcce6fc777d72f","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57053737fefc64e835032aceef0352f00d6e348d14370d8edea2bb55228458f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.26/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.26\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-26:euclid-8-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-26.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 18"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-26:euclid-7-33:explicit","sourceC